    ///       the log files. </p>
    ///          <p> For <code>EventTime</code>, The logs delivered are for a specific day only. The year, month, and
    ///       day correspond to the day on which the event occurred, and the hour, minutes and seconds are set to 00
    ///       in the key.</p>
